  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1460",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-06T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-06T11:54:30.718Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the partial influence of westerly winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने तथा बाँकी पहाडी र तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, as well as in the Himalayan regions of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. The weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining Hilly and Terai regions. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan region of Koshi Province. Mist/fog is likely at a few places in the Terai regions, valleys and river basins during the early morning.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने तथा बाँकी पहाडी र तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of the country, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces, as well as in the Hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
